ve the genomic DNA. sgRNA barcodes were amplified from genomic DNA using Takara Ex-Taq polymerase (Takara RR001C), using 40ug of isolated genomic dna as template per sample, following this protocol, https://media.addgene.org/cms/filer_public/61/16/611619f4-0926-4a07-b5c7-e286a8ecf7f5/broadgpp-sequencing-protocol.pdf. PCR amplicons were agarose gel purified using nucleoSpin Gel and PCR Clean‑up Mini kit (Machery-Nagel cat 740609.50) CRISPR sgRNA amplicons	5163019	387226425	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR145/046/SRR14510446/SRR14510446.fastq.gz	56c8013623234d415ad70c13e9b0cb50	115635610
